  unitName: Black Magress
  unitId: 60013
  unitNumber: 23
  description: A former knight from the utterly devastated Bariura Empire, he later
    became one of the Six Heroes. He was the strongest in Bariura, but while he was
    gone, his parents were murdered. Enraged, he went on to mercilessly kill the
    knights he thought to be responsible. The image of him fighting encouraged the
    people and frightened the knights.
  summonDesc: The world should fear me,<br>for I'm reborn thanks to this<br>foolish
    Summoner!
  fusionDesc: My strength is fueled by anger!<br>Can you control this power!?
  evoDesc: I am reborn in rage.<br>What is it that you desire <br>more than my power?
  element: 6
  rarity: 3
